OL,3,GNEWSAStation not too small after
OL,4,AEverton fans delayed, transport chiefs
OL,5,Asay
OL,6,
OL,7,FMerseyrail has apologised after Everton
OL,8,Ffans reported waits of up to an hour at
OL,9,FSandhills railway station following a
OL,10,Fmatch at the club's new stadium.
OL,12,FA fault was found with a train's
OL,13,Fdoor-monitoring cameras following
OL,14,FWednesday's Carabao Cup match win
OL,15,Fagainst Wolverhampton Wanderers,
OL,16,Fmeaning an additional post-match
OL,17,Fservice was terminated at the station,
OL,18,Fthe nearest to Hill Dickinson Stadium.
OL,20,FAbout 8,000 supporters are thought to
OL,21,Fhave used the station after the match.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
