OL,3,GNEWSAStation not too small after
OL,4,AEverton fans delayed, transport chiefs
OL,5,Asay
OL,6,
OL,7,FMerseyrail said the affected train had
OL,8,Fbeen withdrawn in line with safety
OL,9,Fprocedures. Transport chiefs rejected
OL,10,Fsuggestions Sandhills was too small,
OL,11,Fsaying it was "doing exactly what it
OL,12,Fshould do".
